                        Changes in version 1.5.1
+ SpatialExperiment, SummarizedExperiment, elsa, sp and spdep moved from
  Imports to Suggests, so library(poem) loads much faster (PR #4 by
  btraven00). Install them to use ELSA() or to pass a SpatialExperiment
  to getSpatialExternalMetrics()/getSpatialInternalMetrics().
+ getSpatialInternalMetrics(level="class") now only computes the
  requested metrics.
			Changes in version 1.1.3 (2025-10-21)
+ Fixed bug of metrics argument not being passed with graph input

                        Changes in version 1.1.2
+ lowMemory argument added to getFuzzyPartitionMetrics()
+ returnElementPairAccuracy argument removed from getFuzzyPartitionMetrics(), 
  getFuzzyPartitionGlobalMetrics() and getFuzzyPartitionClassMetrics()
+ SpatialAccuracy metric renamed to nsAccuracy for consistency
+ Bug fixed in getEmbeddingGlobalMetrics() and getFuzzyPartitionMetrics()
